"was last loaded."
msgstr ""

#. module: installed_module_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:installed_module_report.field_installed_module_report__origin
msgid ""
"Worked out from the declared author, refined by the licence: an author of "
"Odoo S.A. with an OPL-1 or OEEL-1 licence is reported as Enterprise, with "
"any other licence as core. An author mentioning \"Odoo Community "
"Association\" or \"(OCA)\" is reported as OCA. Anything else - including a "
"module co-authored by Odoo and a partner - is reported as third party. It "
"reads the manifest, so a manifest that is wrong makes this line wrong."
msgstr ""
